     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nAttention students, managers and researchers who procrastinate 🐌: </div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nIf you have interest in expanding your knowledge of distance sampling, you need to act quickly. There are only a few places remaining for the workshop that takes place 06-17Oct. Registration for the final introductory distance sampling workshop I will deliver\r\n is about to close. <span style=\"color:rgb(237,92,87)\"><b><i>Registration closes at the end of this week</i></b></span> (26Sept25). </div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDetails regarding payment for registration, workshop content, time of day of workshop delivery and other matters of interest can be found on the website below</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<a title=\"https://distancesampling.org/training/announcements/intro-oct-2025.html\" href=\"https://distancesampling.org/training/announcements/intro-oct-2025.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://distancesampling.org/training/announcements/intro-oct-2025.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471488178000&amp;usg=AOvVaw30F9GIH2mLk8R0x9aD2neF\">https://distancesampling.org/training/announcements/intro-oct-2025.html</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nIf you have questions about the workshop or the registration process, contact me by email.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Eric Rexstad</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(12,100,192)\">Centre for Research into Ecological and Environmental Modelling</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">University of St Andrews</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Registered Charity in Scotland SC013532</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Ari